{
  "name": "19 · Mini CRM with Data Tables",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 19 · Mini CRM with Data Tables\nn8n has a **built-in database**: *Data Tables*. No Google Sheets, Airtable or SQL server needed.\n\nThis workflow is a tiny contacts API:\n- `POST /webhook/crm/contacts` → add a contact, or update it if the email already exists (**upsert**). Fields you leave out keep their stored value\n- `GET  /webhook/crm/contacts?stage=lead` → list contacts, optionally filtered by stage\n\n**First:** click ▶ on **Run Once: Create Table** to create the `cookbook_contacts` table (it's safe to run again). You can browse the table under *Overview → Data tables*.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 540
      },
      "id": "19000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
